<title>POLAND: BOS FEB NET RISES TO PLN 8.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS FEB NET RISES TO PLN 8.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  8.42 vs    4.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    8.24 vs    6.71</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 12.96 vs    9.51</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	17.46 vs   17.93</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 14.61 vs    7.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   17.62 vs   13.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 26.55 vs   18.44</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	35.37 vs   36.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
